# Responsive Layout

Build screens with content + flexbox + safe area + constraints.

Forbidden: full-screen `393/852`, `scale(width/393)`, device-name hacks, absolute layout for ordinary UI, magic `top`/`height` coordinates.

Allowed absolute: badges, overlays, modal chrome, artwork, ring-center labels.

Tokens: `src/theme` (`colors`, `spacing`, `typography`, `radius`, `layout`).
Primitives: `src/layout` (`AppScreen`, `ScrollableScreen`, `KeyboardScreen`, `useResponsiveLayout`).
Viewport classes: compact / standard / large. Max content width `430`.
Portrait only.
